<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`projectingLeg` weighs the records' render, the merge base and the disk through `decideProjection`, then pends a vanished file, pins a congruent agreement, or surfaces a standoff under its key. It answers whether the flush writes. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

